# PancakeSwap Farming

Lux can model PancakeSwap pool discovery, yield farming positions, harvests,
auto-compounding, APY optimization, risk checks, and cross-chain migration plans.

## Subgraph Client

```elixir
alias Lux.Integrations.PancakeSwap.Client

Client.farm_pools(:bsc, url: "https://your-masterchef-v3-subgraph/graphql")
Client.positions(:bsc, "0xwallet", url: "https://your-masterchef-v3-subgraph/graphql")
```

## Farming Plans

```elixir
alias Lux.Integrations.PancakeSwap.Farming

pools =
  Farming.optimize_pools(
    [
      %{id: "cake-bnb", chain: :bsc, token0: "CAKE", token1: "BNB", tvl_usd: 5_000_000, fee_apr: 8, reward_apr: 24}
    ],
    min_tvl_usd: 100_000
  )

position =
  Farming.position(%{
    owner: "0xwallet",
    chain: :bsc,
    pool: hd(pools),
    token_id: "42",
    liquidity_usd: 10_000,
    pending_reward_usd: 75,
    gas_cost_usd: 3,
    price_in_range: true
  })

Farming.compound_plan(position, min_reward_usd: 10)
Farming.risk_report(position)
Farming.bridge_plan(position, :base)
```

Plans are deterministic operation lists. A caller can hand those operations to a
wallet/signer layer for real execution.
